  /** Turbidity: 2 = clear mountain air, 3 = clear, 6 = hazy, 10 = thick haze (2..=10). */
  "turbidity"?: number;
  /** Scale from kcd/m² to the written radiance (> 0): 0.05 puts a clear zenith near 0.5. */
